# undergroundWall.mtl -- procedurally generated placeholder material.
# Plain dark stone/earth color with a small emissive term (see
# Stain_Dirt.mtl for why: unlitTexturePS.hlsl only shows ambient+light*Kd
# when there's no texture, so a fully dark corner would otherwise render
# pure black). Deliberately a flat solid color, not a texture -- avoids the
# UV-tiling-on-merged-boxes problem that hit the floor (see
# undergroundFloor.h's comment) since a solid fill can never look
# stretched/seamed no matter how a wall segment gets merged.
newmtl UndergroundStone
Ka 1.000000 1.000000 1.000000
Kd 0.155000 0.148000 0.140000
Ks 0.040000 0.040000 0.040000
Ke 0.012000 0.011000 0.010000
Ns 6.000000
d 1.000000
illum 2
